{"about_the_game":"AudioTheory Grids combines intuitive music theory tools with the power of a grid-based sequencer. Customise your grid, program in a composition and then play it back on the piano and fretboard diagrams. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/d21601dd6882e365c9a051bd334501d1.poster.avif?t=1770997602\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/d21601dd6882e365c9a051bd334501d1.webm?t=1770997602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/d21601dd6882e365c9a051bd334501d1.mp4?t=1770997602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real-time playback across the keyboard and fretboard simultaneously<br></li><li>A comprehensive set of input tools \u2013 cycle through multiple grids and quickly swap between arrangements during playback<br></li><li>Drum grids with a selection of preset sounds<br></li><li>Quickly save and load compositions using the universal text format established with AudioTheory Guitars</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/36aee517d6ce2855ead1fc05306f8e73.poster.avif?t=1770997602\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/36aee517d6ce2855ead1fc05306f8e73.webm?t=1770997602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370780/extras/36aee517d6ce2855ead1fc05306f8e73.mp4?t=1770997602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plus the extensive customisations AudioTheory is known 